WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.676 --> 00:00:04.883
The currencies that flow through this land are my flesh and blood

00:00:06.585 --> 00:00:08.354
For thus did I become the guarantor

00:00:08.856 --> 00:00:13.660
Of the people's hard work, wisdom, and future

00:00:18.028 --> 00:00:20.213
This is the trust I have placed in them

00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:24.946
Betray it, and you taint my blood

00:00:51.706 --> 00:00:55.700
I see. So this is the trial

